  "rationale": "`assets/skills/habeas-requirements/SKILL.md` is a bundled skill, recognized by its front matter, so `requirements.cli.skill_conventions.workflow` applies. After the front matter, the file has the title `# Habeas requirements` and a two-sentence intro paragraph. Its first section is `## Workflow`, and every other section follows it: Writing chapters, Choosing references, What the review checks and Gotchas. The Workflow section is a numbered, ordered list of steps 1–7. Each step is a checkbox item (\"- [ ] 1.\" through \"- [ ] 7.\"), so the workflow is ordered steps. The intro paragraph is not a section, so it does not break the rule that the workflow comes before any other section. No gap.",
